<h1>About</h1>
<p>This project shows my favorite places in the city</p>
<p>Many people in Amman do not know the best places to visit, such as parks, cafés, or relaxing spots. This problem affects students, families, and visitors who want to find nice places easily. Right now, people depend on friends or social media, but the information is not organized and sometimes not clear. Because of this, it takes time to find a good place. This web application can solve this problem by showing favorite places in one simple website. Users can browse places and see details quickly</p>

